title: "Agentic AI Engineer: An Open Learning Hub for Building Real Agentic AI Systems"

abstract: >-
  Agentic AI Engineer is an open learning hub and reference curriculum for
  engineers, researchers, and practitioners building agentic AI systems. The
  material covers autonomous agents, retrieval-augmented generation,
  multi-agent systems, context engineering, evaluation, observability, safety,
  and practical tooling such as LangGraph, the Model Context Protocol,
  Agent-to-Agent communication, LangSmith, and vector databases. The repository
  is organized into learning paths, concept pages, labs, recipes, architecture
  patterns, mathematical foundations, and applied projects.

